meta {
  name: List Documents
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: https://readwise.io/api/v3/list/
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Token {{ACCESS_TOKEN}}
}

params:query {
  ~id: document-id
  ~updatedAfter: 2024-01-01T00:00:00Z
  ~location: new
  ~category: article
  ~tag: example
  ~pageCursor: cursor-string
  ~withHtmlContent: false
  ~withRawSourceUrl: false
}

docs {
  List documents from Readwise Reader.

  Query parameters (all optional):
  - id: Filter by specific document ID
  - updatedAfter: ISO 8601 datetime to filter recently updated documents
  - location: Filter by location (new, later, shortlist, archive, feed)
  - category: Filter by category (article, email, rss, highlight, note, pdf, epub, tweet, video)
  - tag: Filter by tag
  - pageCursor: Pagination cursor from previous response
  - withHtmlContent: Include HTML content in response (boolean)
  - withRawSourceUrl: Include raw source URL (boolean)

  Response includes:
  - count: Total number of documents
  - nextPageCursor: Cursor for next page (null if no more pages)
  - results: Array of document objects
}
